}, {"recommendationid": "68296313", "author": {"steamid": "76561198263730322", "personaname": "XSZ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198263730322/", "num_games_owned": 123, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 21771, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5142, "last_played": 1744988839, "avatar": "bb3ef3a7103423dbfe4947ad72c6a43a84b53fa9"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "挺好一游戏，就是现在游戏体量感觉还是不够大。另外就是有点难受的是任务数量不够，升到18级之后到25级之间有大的空缺，然后就是核心实在tm的太难刷了，每周就几个，而且装饰和模组混在一起，还搞个空白核心，说实话这种增加游戏时长的方法有点恶心，太肝了，晋升完之后的乐趣就开始减少了。要是事件可以获得的奖励是其他的，比如装饰，僬侥好很多，毕竟没有晋升过的玩家完成事件那点奖励根本没啥吸引力。另外精英深浅也贼难打。", "timestamp_created": 1588248412, "timestamp_updated": 1588248412, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "68291341", "author": {"steamid": "76561198322445573", "personaname": "olddriver911", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198322445573/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 8920, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6931, "last_played": 1638618126, "avatar": "4b02ee2d7bd6e0a428890dbd4abb46062682ece9"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "如果社畜生活还没过瘾的话来黑心企业挖挖矿也是很爽的", "timestamp_created": 1588241465, "timestamp_updated": 1588241465, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "68277004", "author": {"steamid": "76561199021237074", "personaname": "EX-AID", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://stea